# ── RAG backend (server/) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# NOTE: GitHub Pages publishes this repo from the root, so anything committed
# under server/ is also served at https://william-brendel.com/server/...
# The corpus and prompts being public is fine — it's all public info, and a
# future browser port would need them fetchable anyway. A secret would NOT be
# fine, hence .env below. Never `git add -f` it.
server/.env
server/node_modules/
server/.model_cache/
server/llms/.model_cache/
